      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-134256",
      ":question/problem": "Consider the data sets $x$ and $y$ of paired observations. The equation of the corresponding linear regression line for this data is\n$y =-2.1x + 3$.\nAccording to the model, what is the residual at $x = 10$ if the actual value of $y$ corresponding to this value of $x$ is $-22$?"
