      ":question/math-academy-id": "q-134266",
      ":question/problem": "An antique broker has records about the value of an artwork $y$ (in thousands of dollars) at certain times $x$ (in decades) since the artwork was produced. The equation of the corresponding linear regression line for this data is\n$y = 3.2x + 4.5$.\nWhat is the residual $5$ decades after the artwork was produced if the actual value of the artwork after $5$ decades is $$23000$?"
